		{"id":"4939cdc288336a61","type":"text","text":"### 30 Seconds... Game Rules\n\n1. You play in pairs against other pairs \n    \n2. Take turns picking a card and describing the Password in English to your teammate.\n    \n3. Do not say the word or use parts of the word.\n    \n4. Do not speak Dutch, point or use gestures.\n    \n5. Your group has 30 seconds to guess the word.\n    \n6. Theteam who guesses correctly earns one point per answer given.","x":591,"y":-234,"width":482,"height":460,"color":"3"}
